OL,3,GNEWSAShop owner retires after 40 years
OL,4,Aat historic store
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the past 40 years, Martin
OL,7,FColes-Evans has rarely had a weekend
OL,8,Foff while running a shop that has
OL,9,Fserved the community for more than a
OL,10,Fcentury.
OL,12,FThe 55-year-old took over the homeware
OL,13,Fstore Hargreaves in Buxton, Derbyshire,
OL,14,Ffrom his parents, but is now retiring
OL,15,Fand the building is up for sale.
OL,17,F"I think I've done a long enough
OL,18,Fshift," he said. "The next generation
OL,19,Fof our family have chosen their own
OL,20,Fpath, so Hargreaves was always going to
OL,21,Fend with me.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
